  "notes": "Warm off-white page (#f5f3ee) with dark teal chrome and a violet 'your hold' identity colour carried into the banner, slot chip and compare column. Slot chips use a strict colour code: green = works for everyone, grey strikethrough = Dele working, dashed blue = check Dele's shift; '€' marks expedited. Office letter avatars H/N/L in coloured squares. Hatched diagonal textures mark registry closures and yellow hatching school holidays. A/B circle markers link grid chips to compare columns. Every opening is annotated with per-person trade-offs (Dele / Kids / You) with check, cross and dash glyphs. The countdown hold is a central motif (also a progress line under the banner and a 'hold ends' pill). Slot layout is a multi-week grid (weeks as rows, weekdays as columns) with slots inside cells — coded as calendar-month-then-list as nearest value."
